k","text_tcs_leopards_courier":"TCS / Leopards Courier","text_remote_addresses_or_extreme_seasonal_weather_conditions":"* Remote addresses or extreme seasonal weather conditions may occasionally add 24–48 hours to transit windows.","text_cash_on_delivery_cod_payment_verification":"Cash on Delivery (COD) & Payment Verification","text_cash_on_delivery_is_available_across_all_serviceable_de":"Cash on Delivery is available across all serviceable delivery zones in Pakistan. Please ensure the exact cash amount is ready for the courier rider upon delivery. For first-time customers or high-value orders, our care team may reach out via WhatsApp at ","text_to_confirm_your_delivery_address_prior_to_handing_parce":" to confirm your delivery address prior to handing parcels over to TCS or Leopards.","text_for_online_bank_transfers_ibft_jazzcash_or_easypaisa_ou":"For online bank transfers (IBFT), JazzCash, or Easypaisa, our accounts team manually verifies the transaction ID or payment screenshot before releasing your parcel to dispatch.","text_airtight_packaging_transit_protection":"Airtight Packaging & Transit Protection","text_all_raw_seeds_are_heat_sealed_in_thick_food_grade_moist":"All raw seeds are heat-sealed in thick, food-grade moisture-barrier pouches with tamper-evident tear notches and press-to-close airtight locks. Loose-leaf chamomile flowers and delicate botanicals are protected inside sturdy, bubble-cushioned outer boxes to prevent crushing during transit.","text_order_tracking_delivery_support":"Order Tracking & Delivery Support","text_courier_details_appear_on_your_order_tracking_page_when":"Courier details appear on your order tracking page when your parcel is dispatched. For order status inquiries, reach out directly to our customer care team on WhatsApp at","text_or_email":"or email"},"links":{},"images":{},"sections":[{"id":"page_section_01","enabled":true},{"id":"page_section_02","enabled":true}]},"definition":{"slug":"shipping","title":"shipping","descripti