, or with a broken courier seal during transit.","text_verified_quality_or_freshness_issue_such_as_unexpected":"Verified quality or freshness issue (such as unexpected staleness, off-odour, or rancidity reported within 7 days of delivery).","text_incorrect_seed_variety_tea_blend_or_routine_kit_receive":"Incorrect seed variety, tea blend, or routine kit received compared to your confirmed invoice.","text_verified_packaging_defect_such_as_pouch_tear_or_comprom":"Verified packaging defect (such as pouch tear or compromised resealable zipper upon unboxing).","text_how_to_initiate_a_claim":"How to Initiate a Claim","text_please_contact_our_customer_care_team_within":"Please contact our customer care team within ","text_7_days_of_delivery":"7 days of delivery","text_with_your_order_number_e_g_sed_xxxxxx_and_1_2_clear_pho":" with your order number (e.g. SED-XXXXXX) and 1–2 clear photographs or an unboxing video showing the affected item:","text_whatsapp_helpline":"WhatsApp Helpline","text_email_support":"Email Support","text_refund_methods_timelines":"Refund Methods & Timelines","text_if_an_immediate_replacement_is_not_preferred_an_approve":"If an immediate replacement is not preferred, an approved refund will be processed back to your chosen payment method within ","text_2_3_business_days":"2–3 business days","text_for_cash_on_delivery_cod_orders_refunds_are_transferred":". For Cash on Delivery (COD) orders, refunds are transferred directly via ","text_jazzcash":"JazzCash","text_easypaisa":"Easypaisa","text_or":", or ","text_pakistani_online_bank_transfer_ibft":"Pakistani online bank transfer (IBFT)"},"links":{},"images":{},"sections":[{"id":"page_section_01","enabled":true},{"id":"page_section_02","enabled":true},{"id":"page_section_03","enabled":true}]},"definition":{"slug":"returns","title":"returns","description":"Website content and search information for returns.","kind":"page","fields":[{"key":"seo","label":"Seo","type":"object","fields":[{"key":"title","label":"Ti