ave the right to request access to correction of o","type":"textarea","required":true,"maxLength":16000},{"key":"text_or_email","label":"Or email","type":"textarea","required":true,"maxLength":16000}]},{"key":"links","label":"Links","type":"object","fields":[]},{"key":"images","label":"Images","type":"object","fields":[]},{"key":"sections","label":"Sections","type":"list","min":7,"max":7,"item":{"key":"item","label":"Item","type":"object","fields":[{"key":"id","label":"Id","type":"select","required":true,"options":[{"value":"page_section_01","label":"page section 01"},{"value":"page_section_02","label":"page section 02"},{"value":"page_section_03","label":"page section 03"},{"value":"page_section_04","label":"page section 04"},{"value":"page_section_05","label":"page section 05"},{"value":"page_section_06","label":"page section 06"},{"value":"page_section_07","label":"page section 07"}],"maxLength":80},{"key":"enabled","label":"Enabled","type":"boolean"}]}}]},"route":"/privacy"},{"slug":"terms","kind":"page","title":"terms","description":"Website content and search information for terms.","publish":true,"content":{"seo":{"title":"Terms of Service | Seedly Pakistan","description":"Clear, transparent shopping terms for catalog orders, courier delivery, payments, and 7-day replacements on Seedly.pk."},"copy":{"text_legal_terms":"Legal Terms","text_terms_of_service":"Terms of Service","text_straightforward_terms_governing_catalog_orders_nationwi":"Straightforward terms governing catalog orders, nationwide courier dispatch, payment processing, and consumer safety on Seedly.pk.","text_1_orders_address_verification":"1. Orders & Address Verification","text_when_you_place_an_order_on_seedly_pk_you_will_receive_a":"When you place an order on Seedly.pk, you will receive an immediate order number (e.g., SED-XXXXXX) and automated confirmation. Please ensure your shipping address, city, and active mobile number are accurate. For first-time Cash on Delivery orders, our care team may reach out via WhatsApp to verify shipping details before dispatching parcels with TCS or Leopards Courier.","text_2_pricing_payment_options":"2. Pricing & Payment Options","text_all_prices_are_listed_in_pakistani_rupees_pkr_and_inclu":"All prices are listed in Pakistani Rupees (PKR) and inclusive of packaging costs. We offer three transparent payment channels: Cash on Delivery (COD) paid to the courier upon delivery, mobile wallets (JazzCash and Easypaisa), and direct Pakistani bank transfer (IBFT). Digital transfers are manually reviewed and verified by our accounts team against your submitted transaction ID or proof of payment prior to dispatch.","text_3_nationwide_courier_dispatch":"3. Nationwide Courier Dispatch","text_orders_placed_by_3_00_pm_pkt_monday_to_saturday_are_dis":"Orders placed by 3:00 PM PKT (Monday to Saturday) are dispatched the same day from our central Lahore hub via ","text_tcs":"TCS","text_and":" and ","text_leopards_courier":"Leopards Courier","text_expected_transit_times_are":". Expected transit times are:","text_current_delivery_charges_and_any_free_delivery_threshol":"Current delivery charges and any free-delivery threshold are shown in your basket and confirmed before you place your order.","text_4_7_day_replacement_guarantee_food_safety_returns":"4. 7-Day Replacement Guarantee & Food Safety Returns","text_5_food_notice_dietary_status":"5. Food Notice & Dietary Status","text_6_customer_care_inquiries":"6. Customer Care & Inquiries","text_for_any_questions_regarding_these_terms_your_order_stat":"For any questions regarding these terms, your order status, or dietary guidance, contact our team Monday to Saturday (9am–7pm PKT) at","text_whatsapp":"WhatsApp ","text_or_email":"or email"},"links":{},"images":{},"sections":[{"id":"page_section_01","enabled":true},{"id":"page_section_02","enabled":true},{"id":"page_section_03","enabled":true},{"id":"page_section_04","enabled":true},{"id":"page_section_05","enabled":true},{"id":"page_section_06